We’re glad to announce that Update 1.2 is now available on the new Public Beta branch on Steam! This update also contains support for the long-awaited Steam Achievements.
[list]
[h1] Changelog: [/h1]
[*]Added support for 23 Steam Achievements;
[*]Upgraded to the latest version of the Unreal Development Kit;
[*]Smoother character animation blending;
[*]Minor AI improvements;
[*]Fixed sound issues.
[/list]
We wanted to share the improvements with you sooner than we otherwise could, thus we chose to release this update as a Public Beta. To switch to the Beta branch check out the [url=http://steamcommunity.com/app/407780/discussions/2/217690940937688003/] instructions to access the Beta[/url]. We’re very keen to receive your feedback in the [url=http://steamcommunity.com/app/407780/discussions/2/] new Beta forum[/url]!

