The second major update for Lethe – Episode One is now available, the following changes have been made:
[list]
    [*]We rebuilt the save system to eliminate any chance of the save files becoming unusable: they will always load properly now (even saves from before this update!);
    [*]Placed additional save points and autosaves in all levels;
    [*]Added warning messages in the Pause Menu when dealing with unsaved progress;
    [*]We tweaked the water: you’re slightly less likely to drown now;
    [*]Made it a bit easier to see in the dark: less wall-hugging required;
    [*]Increased the maximum Gamma value for those who still want more brightness;
    [*]Health and Energy (Lethaum) potions now provide more of the good stuff;
    [*]Made it less likely that you’d accidentally skip through the ending sequence;
    [*]Removed unused keybindings that would cause trouble when trying to rebind;
    [*]Fixed some controller prompts in the Tutorials not showing up properly;
    [*]General collision & physics improvements;
    [*]Made the fragile crates slightly more fragile;
    [*]Tweaked some Post-Processing effects.
[/list]
We strongly recommend you update to the latest version for the best experience.

